    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "ABOUT LAGERHEADS:<br>Lagerheads is a secluded gem situated in the tranquil community of Inlet Beach adjacent to Rosemary Beach. Offering a comprehensive array of amenities, Lagerheads encompasses golf, sand, surf, WiFi, unique boutiques, and dining options. Guests can bask in the sun, take a dip in the pool, or leisurely walk to the pristine white sandy beaches just half a block away. The property presents an ideal setting for a perfect retreat, with a short walk or bike ride to neighboring destinations such as Rosemary Beach, Seacrest, or Aly's Beach.<br><br>Lagerheads is a two-story, 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom vacation home that comfortably accommodates up to 14 guests. Recently refurbished, the home features new flooring on the second floor, updated bathroom vanities, modern appliances, and refreshed kitchen and decor. Upon entering the main floor, guests are greeted with a charming kids' \"hang out\" area, complete with vibrant bean bag chairs and a flat-screen TV with Blue Ray/DVD player. Additionally, there is a kids' room with two bunk beds, each featuring a full-sized bed on the bottom bunk, catering to a total of six children. A king-sized bedroom and a newly renovated full bathroom with double sinks and a shower are also located on the first floor.<br><br>The second floor boasts an expansive open living area, dining space, and fully-equipped kitchen with ample seating for all guests. Guests can relax on the spacious open deck, grill, sip cocktails, and oversee the pool activities below. An alternative dining option is available on the large screened front porch, offering breathtaking sunset views over the Gulf. Furthermore, the second floor comprises a luxurious Master King Suite with a private bathroom, a large guest room with two queen beds, and a full bath in the hallway.<br><br>Guests can relish the expansive yard, ideal for children and pets, and partake in recreational activities such as volleyball, badminton, or cornhole, with equipment provided on the premises. Alternatively, guests can utilize the complimentary beach set or the four bicycles provided for further exploration. For added convenience, a new fully enclosed outdoor shower with hot/cold water and an electric car charger have been recently installed for the benefit of environmentally conscious guests.<br><br>ABOUT THE AREA:<br>Inlet Beach is a charming beach neighborhood located along Florida s scenic Highway 30A. Known for its stunning white sandy beaches, crystal-clear waters, and relaxed atmosphere, Inlet Beach offers a peaceful coastal getaway for visitors seeking a more laid-back vacation experience. This quaint community is characterized by its quiet residential streets lined with beautiful beach cottages and upscale vacation homes, perfect for those looking to unwind and enjoy the natural beauty of the Gulf Coast.<br><br>Inlet Beach provides easy access to a variety of outdoor activities, including swimming, sunbathing, paddleboarding, kayaking, and fishing. The nearby Camp Helen State Park offers nature trails for hiking and birdwatching, while Lake Powell - one of Florida's largest coastal dune lakes - provides opportunities for boating and wildlife viewing. Visitors can also explore the neighboring beach communities of Rosemary Beach, Seacrest Beach, and Aly s Beach, each offering unique shopping, dining, and entertainment options.<br><br>With its pristine beaches, serene ambiance, and proximity to a wealth of recreational opportunities, Inlet Beach is a hidden gem along Highway 30A, perfect for those seeking a peaceful retreat on Florida s Gulf Coast.<br><br>BEACH ACCESS:<br>* Inlet beach public beach access.<br><br>PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:<br>* Beach service is included. (2 chairs & 1 umbrella). This is seasonal from March 1-October31. <br>* 3 minute walk to the beach.<br>* 4 bikes included.<br>* Private Pool<br>* Gulf views<br><br>PARKING:<br>* Free Parking up to 3 Vehicles<br><br>PROPERTY RULES:<br>* Must sign rental agreement within 48 hrs of booking or subject to cancellation<br>* If you choose to bring your dog/s, there is an additional, non-refundable pet fee of $250 per dog. The fee is to be charged after reservation confirmation.<br>* Must Be 25 years or older<br><br>DISCLOSURE:<br>Please be aware this area has a lot of development and new construction going on. At any given point adjacent properties to properties we manage may go under construction to which we are not notified. Paradise Properties is not liable for any construction happening outside of the properties we manage.<br><br>​​​​​​​ABOUT PARADISE PROPERTIES:<br>When you book your vacation in Florida's Panhandle with Paradise Properties Vacation Rentals and Sales, you can expect first class customer service from the moment you inquire. All of our properties are professionally cleaned, inspected, and maintained at the highest level. We are located close to all of our properties and we are available 24 hours per day and 7 days per week to ensure your vacation is flawless. Our goal is to build a lasting memory for all of our guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
